Package: kmmr
Type: Package
Title: Kernel-based linear mixed models in R
Version: 0.1
Date: 2026-03-10
Author: Killian A.C. Melsen
Maintainer: Killian A.C. Melsen <killian.melsen@wur.nl>
Description: Fits multivariate linear mixed models in R, with the analysis of plant breeding multi-environment trial data as the main application. Comes with the ability to use several types of linear and non-linear kernels as well as structured and unstructured covariance matrices.
